WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.385
- I wanna know 'cause you've been on SNL,

00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:03.994
I wanna know, what are
your favorite characters

00:00:03.994 --> 00:00:05.658
that you've ever gotten to play?

00:00:05.658 --> 00:00:07.266
- Wow!

00:00:07.266 --> 00:00:09.877
I mean, any time I was on camera at SNL,

00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:12.340
15-year-old me was
extremely excited about it

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.924
but I mean, gosh, they all change.

00:00:15.924 --> 00:00:17.543
- It is a certain energy
when you're there.

00:00:17.543 --> 00:00:19.133
I've been there just performing and stuff.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:20.027
- You've hosted.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:21.497
- No, I didn't... no.

00:00:21.497 --> 00:00:22.330
- You have to,

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.005
you would be a perfect host.
- It's such a commitment.

00:00:24.005 --> 00:00:25.903
(Kelly chuckles)
(audience cheers)

00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:28.841
I was actually in New York
when Blake Shelton hosted

00:00:28.841 --> 00:00:29.765
'cause my ex manager--
- Oh, I was there for that.

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:30.895
He was great.
- I know.

00:00:30.895 --> 00:00:31.977
But it's a commitment.

00:00:31.977 --> 00:00:32.957
Y'all work all week.

00:00:32.957 --> 00:00:33.790
People don't get it.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.002
It's not, just Saturday night.

00:00:35.002 --> 00:00:37.030
It's like all week long.
- No, it's a lotta work.

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:37.863
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:39.008
I feel like you are someone

00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:40.520
that would excel at it, though,

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.962
'cause you're hilarious
- Oh, really?

00:00:41.962 --> 00:00:42.795
and you don't,

00:00:42.795 --> 00:00:44.778
I feel like you would let them have fun

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.822
and have a good time.

00:00:45.822 --> 00:00:47.827
- Oh, I would definitely
lean in and have a good time.

00:00:47.827 --> 00:00:49.465
- Yeah. I feel like you
would be a great host.

00:00:49.465 --> 00:00:50.298
I wanna see it.
- Okay. Okay.

00:00:50.298 --> 00:00:51.456
Okay (laughs) (claps).
(audience cheers)

00:00:51.456 --> 00:00:53.242
(Bobby laughs)
I love that.

00:00:53.242 --> 00:00:54.688
Thank you. Thank you

00:00:54.688 --> 00:00:55.521
- Blake was great.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:56.601
Blake was fantastic.
- Do you remember

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:57.971
your very first time that you were on SNL?

00:00:57.971 --> 00:00:59.523
'Cause you said your 15-year-old
self was freaking out.

00:00:59.523 --> 00:01:01.520
So what was your first, do you remember?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.669
- Yeah, I totally remember.

00:01:03.669 --> 00:01:05.536
It was like space camp.
- [Kelly] Ah.

00:01:05.536 --> 00:01:06.811
It was nuts.

00:01:06.811 --> 00:01:09.206
The first episode was
the only one I enjoyed,

00:01:09.206 --> 00:01:10.102
because I was like,
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:11.007
"I'm here I can't believe it!"

00:01:11.007 --> 00:01:12.515
And then it was a job after that.

00:01:12.515 --> 00:01:13.859
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:13.859 --> 00:01:17.337
- Yeah, no, I definitely
in between two scenes

00:01:17.337 --> 00:01:18.879
in my first episode,

00:01:18.879 --> 00:01:21.680
ran full speed across the studio

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.029
and changed really fast
'cause we're on live TV

00:01:24.029 --> 00:01:25.934
and then I had like a minute and a half--

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:27.805
- Yeah. But you think
it's quick change, yeah.

00:01:27.805 --> 00:01:29.011
- And I was just standing
there going like (lips trill),

00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:29.844
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:29.844 --> 00:01:31.679
"I guess I'm very excited
to be here." (chuckles)

00:01:31.679 --> 00:01:32.512
- (laughs) Yeah. Oh my God.

00:01:32.512 --> 00:01:34.388
You got your pocket
protector on, you're like,

00:01:34.388 --> 00:01:35.929
"Really..." (laughs).
- Yeah, I was very...

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.838
my old SNL book (laughs).
- (laughs) Love it.

